# Who This Guide Is For

SmartTouch serves multiple types of users, each with different responsibilities, permissions, and API access levels. Understanding your role helps you determine which endpoints you can access and which workflows are available to you.

## Home Owners

You can use Your mobile or a web application to  control and monitor connected devices.

